BT 1 0 0 1 0 60.5 Tm /F1 9.5 Tf 14 TL (The program is implemented in one source file, main.py, to keep the example easy to run. Functions separate) Tj T* (each operation from menu control. The re module is used to normalize whitespace and optionally remove) Tj T* (punctuation. pathlib is used for file reading and writing. The find\(\) method is used for searching, len\(\) and split\(\) for) Tj T* (counting, and slicing syntax for extracting text. Exceptions prevent common input and file errors from crashing the) Tj T* (application.) Tj T* ET
Q
